    <Placemark>
      <name>Gin Talk and Tasting on HMS Belfast</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Gin Talk and Tasting on HMS Belfast</b><br><i>Food &amp; Drink</i><br>Tue 9th Jun<br>HMS Belfast, Southwark<br>£20<br><br>Celebrate National Gin Day aboard HMS Belfast with a talk on gin's history in the Armed Forces. Enjoy a tasting of Veteran Gin's award-winning London dry, with proceeds supporting veterans. Event is on 13th June 2026, 6:30pm to 7:45pm.<br><br><a href="https://www.ianvisits.co.uk/calendar/up-spirits-gin-talk-and-tasting-on-hms-belfast-429494/">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#red-dot.png</styleUrl>
      <Point>
        <coordinates>-0.0811518,51.5065428,0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Romeo and Juliet</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Romeo and Juliet</b><br><i>Theatre</i><br>Tue 9th Jun – Sat 20th Jun<br>Harold Pinter Theatre, West End<br>from £24<br><br>Sadie Sink and Noah Jupe make their West End debuts in this new adaptation of Shakespeare's tragedy. Running time is 2 hours 55 minutes, including one interval. Show runs until 20th June 2026.<br><br><a href="https://www.londonboxoffice.co.uk/all-london-shows/june">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
