      <description><![CDATA[<b>Gimme! Gimme! Gimme! Bottomless Brunch</b><br><i>Food &amp; Drink</i><br>Sat 13th Jun<br>Circe’s Rooftop Waterloo, Waterloo<br>from £42.90 – £59.40<br><br>Join a rooftop ABBA-themed brunch with live performances, bottomless cocktails, and brunch. Tickets from £42.90, event on 13th June 2026.<br><br><a href="https://www.designmynight.com/london/bars/waterloo/circes-waterloo/mamma-mia-bottomless-brunch">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
