    <Placemark>
      <name>Trooping The Colour</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Trooping The Colour</b><br><i>Cultural</i><br>Sat 13th Jun<br>Horse Guards Parade, Westminster<br>free to watch from certain points, tickets vary from £10 – £30<br><br>The King's Birthday Parade features prime pageantry. Free viewing along the Mall or St James's Park. Grandstand seating is limited and highly sought after.<br><br><a href="https://www.londonperfect.com/plan-your-trip/events-in-london/june.php">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#orange-dot.png</styleUrl>
      <Point>
        <coordinates>-0.127054,51.504775,0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Gun Salutes</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Gun Salutes</b><br><i>Cultural</i><br>Tue 9th Jun<br>Various locations, Green Park and Tower of London<br>Free<br><br>Two sets of military gun salutes mark the Official Birthday of HM The King. The first is in Green Park at 12:52pm, preceded by a horse-drawn arrival ceremony. The second is at 1pm outside the Tower of London, with a better view often from Tower Bridge.<br><br><a href="https://www.ianvisits.co.uk/calendar/gun-salutes-in-green-park-and-tower-of-london-372330/">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#orange-dot.png</styleUrl>
      <Point>
        <coordinates>-0.0754722,51.5055748,0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
