      <description><![CDATA[<b>Cruise ship passing through Tower Bridge</b><br><i>Cultural</i><br>Wed 10th Jun<br>Tower Bridge, Southwark<br>Free<br><br>The cruise ship World Voyager will pass through Tower Bridge. Arriving at 1:15pm, it's something to look out for if in the area.<br><br><a href="https://www.ianvisits.co.uk/calendar/weekend/">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
