      <name>BMW Classics 2026</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>BMW Classics 2026</b><br><i>Music</i><br>Sat 13th Jun<br>Trafalgar Square, Westminster<br>Free<br><br>The London Symphony Orchestra performs a free outdoor concert in Trafalgar Square. Conducted by Sir Antonio Pappano, the programme includes highlights from Holst’s The Planets and Elgar’s Enigma Variations, plus the world premiere of Louise Drewett’s Four Dances.<br><br><a href="https://www.london.gov.uk/events/bmw-classics-2026">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
