    <Placemark>
      <name>Mother Courage and Her Children</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Mother Courage and Her Children</b><br><i>Theatre</i><br>Thu 7th May – Sat 27th Jun<br>Globe Theatre, South Bank<br>from £8<br><br>Follow Mother Courage as she navigates a war-torn world, selling goods from her cart to survive. This production, set in a dystopian setting, explores themes of fascism, family, and complicity. Michelle Terry leads the cast as Mother Courage.<br><br><a href="https://www.londontheatre.co.uk/show/46231-mother-courage-and-her-children-globe">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
