      <description><![CDATA[<b>HOLY POP!</b><br><i>Arts &amp; Culture</i><br>Thu 21st May – Sun 9th Aug<br>Somerset House, Strand<br>Free<br><br>Explore modern shrines and how we honor heroes and celebrities. This exhibition delves into the world of contemporary icons and the ways we pay tribute to them.<br><br><a href="https://londontheinside.com/map/exhibitions-2/">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
